# Provenance

This repository was extracted, with its history, from the Cairn monorepo. It is not a
fresh start: every commit before the rewrite commits listed at the end of this file is a
commit of that history, filtered to the paths this repository owns.

| | |
|---|---|
| Source | <[[.SourceURL]]> |
| Source tag | `[[.Ref]]` |
| Source commit | `[[.SourceSHA]]` |
| Extraction | `git filter-repo` [[.FilterRepo]], driven by `split/extract` in that repository |
| Path map | `split/paths.tsv` in that repository, at the commit above |

